    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "It is a very exciting time and obviously a lot is going on. And we're talking about the state of our country, the state of our union, the state of our republic, where we are and where we're going. That's the whole point of the state of the union. And it is in the voice of the president who's giving it. So for example, when it was President Obama or President Biden, I might not have agreed with everything they said, but they were the president, and I was going to listen to them and hear what they had to say. So I would have never considered boycotting a state of the union. It just doesn't seem like the right thing to do as an American to me.",
