        "text": "Collaboration between businesses and government improves business outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The success of businesses is valuable and should be promoted.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Employment growth is a positive outcome of business success.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker and listener share a common understanding of who represents businesses.",
